<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-ZEMES BANK 7-MO PROFIT 701,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-ZEMES BANK 7-MO PROFIT 701,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven months 1997</p>
<p>				  (million lats unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit					  701,000 lats</p>
<p> Assets						51.977</p>
<p> Claims on other credit institutions	 13.046</p>
<p> Deposits					    28.609</p>
<p> Individual deposits				5.671</p>
<p> Credits					     20.335</p>
<p> Government bonds				   2.021</p>
<p>NOTE - Zemes Bank gave no comparisons for its seven month</p>
<p>results.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
